    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: 1. Improvement of national highway sections from Mazar-e-Sharif to Dara-i-Suf 
Indicator: The project road to be improved to a standard that allows smooth passage of all types of vehicles with the improvement of international roughness index to 5 after project completion 
Progress/Status: Con 1: Mazar-i-Sharif - Poli Baraq (76 km) is 100% complete; Con 2: Poli Baraq -Dara-i-Suf (58.94 km) is 100% complete; International roughness index is under 5. Both of the road sections were open to traffic during construction. 
